 "title": "f. 233, lines 8&ndash;13: four thousand men before Palota",
 "caption": "Six lines of the ciphered page f. 233, sign by sign, with the values of the rebuilt System A′ key. The numerals 4 o o o stand for 4000; “More Lesli” is László Móré and the castle is Palota (Várpalota). The bar marks the end of a manuscript line.",
